{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Proficiency with advanced weapons\n\nYou are well-versed in the use of Blackpowder weapons and wield them with deadly efficiency. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You ignore the loading property of Blackpowder weapons with which you are proficient.\n\n- Whenever you start your turn within 10 feet of a creature or a creature moves within 10 feet you can use your reaction to make a ranged weapon attack against that creature with a blackpowder weapon. This attack ignores disadvantage caused by being within melee range of that creature.","level":1}],"id":"Custom7cfd2bbb-6a1a-4e54-97cf-684de82c84be","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Blackpowder Expert [GH] [NPHB]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}